<title>FRANCE: SGS-Thomson buys majority in Metaflow.</title>
<headline>SGS-Thomson buys majority in Metaflow.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS-Thomson Microelectronics NV said in a statement on Thursday that it had acquired a majority stake in Metaflow Technologies Inc, a specialist developer of microprocessor architectures based in San Diego.</p>
<p>It did not disclose the price. Metaflow was privately-held.</p>
</text>
